# A relayed DHCPDISCOVER whose option 82 carries a circuit ID, a link selection sub-option
# (RFC 3527, 203.0.113.0) and a server identifier override sub-option (RFC 5107,
# 203.0.113.1); not padded. Modelled by hand on the option order and parameter request
# list this client sends; documentation addresses (RFC 5737) and MACs (RFC 7042).
#
# op 1, htype 1, hlen 6, hops 1
01 01 06 01
# xid
a1 01 18 09
# secs, flags
00 00 00 00
# ciaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# yiaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# siaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# giaddr 192.0.2.1
c0 00 02 01
# chaddr
00 00 5e 00 53 18 00*10
# sname: empty
00*64
# file: empty
00*128
# magic cookie
63 82 53 63
# option 53: DHCPDISCOVER
35 01 01
# option 55: parameter request list
37 03 01 03 06
# option 82: relay agent information: circuit ID 0007, link selection 203.0.113.0, server identifier override 203.0.113.1
52 10 01 02 00 07 05 04 cb 00 71 00 0b 04 cb 00
71 01
# end
ff
